# Plasma configuration, generated from Arch (plasmashell 6.7.5) via
#   nix run github:nix-community/plasma-manager#rc2nix
# then pruned by hand.
#
# Import into home-manager:
#   imports = [ inputs.plasma-manager.homeModules.plasma-manager ./plasma.nix ];
#
# Dropped from the raw dump (kept as plasma-rc2nix-full.nix): unbound
# shortcuts, Chrome-extension shortcuts, Latte Dock (dead upstream, no
# Plasma 6 support), khotkeysrc (stock KDE3 demo gestures; khotkeys is
# gone in Plasma 6), katerc + Kate session state, kmixrc (audio profiles
# are hardware-specific), and the usersWallpapers path list.
{ ... }:
